@startuml dma_stream_state
title Stream<C, N> lifecycle

[*] --> Uninitialized
Uninitialized --> Idle : Init()

Idle --> Configured : Configure() [valid]
Idle --> Idle : Configure() [invalid] / kInvalidConfig

Configured --> Configured : Configure()
Configured --> Busy : Start() [count > 0, reachable]
Configured --> Configured : Start() [invalid] / kInvalidLength, kInvalidAddress

Busy : entry / SxCR.EN = 1
Busy : Start() / kBusy

Busy --> Configured : TC [mode == kNormal] / callback(kTransferComplete)
Busy --> Busy : HT / callback(kHalfTransfer)
Busy --> Busy : TC [mode == kCircular] / callback(kTransferComplete)
Busy --> Error : TE or DME / EN = 0, callback(error)
Busy --> Busy : FE [fifo mode] / callback(kFifoError)
Busy --> Configured : Stop()

Error --> Configured : Configure() or Stop()
@enduml
